---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

// Phase 5 Draft Route: Awaiting finalized leadership bios and legal entity details (docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md)
const draft = true;
---

<Base
  title="About SAPVIK | Engineering & Growth Partner"
  description="Learn about the SAPVIK engineering philosophy, founding mission, and technical leadership driving digital growth for commercial enterprises in India."
  noindex={draft}
>
  <div class="about-page-section" style="padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2.5rem); padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      
      <!-- Draft Notice Banner -->
      <aside class="draft-indicator" aria-label="Draft Notice" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background: #FFF9E6; border: 1px solid #FFE58F; padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: #874D00;">
        <strong>[DRAFT ROUTE &bull; NOINDEX]</strong> This About page layout is prepared and excluded from the sitemap. Awaiting verifiable leadership bios, company registration numbers, and founding story per <code>docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md</code>.
      </aside>

      <!-- Section Header -->
      <header class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">ORGANIZATION &bull; ABOUT</span>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
          Engineering Rigor Meets Commercial Growth
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 760px;">
          SAPVIK was founded on a simple principle: businesses grow faster when their digital presence is engineered with high technical standards, verified data telemetry, and total ownership of commercial assets.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">01 &bull; CORE PILLAR</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Static-First Edge Engineering
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            We build ultra-fast, accessible web platforms that eliminate layout shifts and reduce mobile bounce rates across variable Indian mobile networks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">02 &bull; CORE PILLAR</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Direct Commercial Attribution
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            We focus on genuine customer acquisition, inbound telephone calls, and revenue return, rather than inflated impressions or vanity metrics.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">03 &bull; CORE PILLAR</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            100% Client Asset Ownership
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            Clients retain full administrative custody of their domain DNS, codebase, ad accounts, and telemetry without proprietary agency lock-in.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Leadership Slot -->
      <section class="frame-box" style="padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="mono-label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          LEADERSHIP &amp; ENGINEERING
        </span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Executive Team &amp; Technical Leads
        </h2>
        <div style="background: var(--c-surface); border: 1px dashed var(--c-border); padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--c-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">
          [Leadership bios, verified credentials, and LinkedIn profiles will be populated following company confirmation per <code>docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md</code>]
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Operational Commitments -->
      <section class="frame-box" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          COMPANY STANDARDS
        </span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Our Operating Commitments
        </h2>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55;">
          <li>&bull; <strong>Strict Response SLAs:</strong> Diagnostic responses delivered within 24 business hours.</li>
          <li>&bull; <strong>Direct Platform Billing:</strong> Client pays advertising networks directly with direct corporate invoicing.</li>
          <li>&bull; <strong>Data Privacy:</strong> Strict compliance with Indian DPDP standards and Google Consent Mode v2.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
